cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research project, please cite the author and manuscript."
title: "Finite Exact Valuation-Word Cylinders in the Accelerated Syracuse Map"
authors:
  - family-names: Lubuimi
    given-names: Ta-Yoshua
date-released: 2026-11-10
version: "0.1.0"
type: article
abstract: >-
  An independent derivation of the classical finite parity-vector congruence coding
  in accelerated-Syracuse valuation coordinates. Every finite exact valuation word
  determines one odd residue class modulo the corresponding power of two, with
  relative odd density given by its total exponent. No novelty or priority claim is made.
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - Syracuse dynamics
  - 2-adic valuation
  - residue cylinders
  - affine offset identity
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi"
